# 📊 Complexity Summary

| Problem | Time | Space |
|----------|----------|----------|
| Unbounded Knapsack | O(N*W) | O(N*W) |
| Rod Cutting | O(N²) | O(N²) |
| Coin Change I | O(N*T) | O(N*T) |
| Coin Change II | O(N*T) | O(N*T) |
| Target Sum | O(N*Sum) | O(N*Sum) |
