# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Rod Cutting = Unbounded Knapsack.

✅ Coin Change I = Minimum Coins.

✅ Coin Change II = Count Ways.

✅ Target Sum reduces to Subset Sum.

✅ Partition Difference reduces to Count Subsets.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using 0/1 recurrence for Unbounded problems.

❌ Wrong Target Sum conversion.

❌ Confusing Coin Change I and II.

❌ Not handling impossible cases.

❌ Forgetting base cases.

